@startuml Sequence_Customer_CitraFrame

title Sequence Diagram Pelanggan (Customer) - Sistem CitraFrame

autonumber
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #333333
  ActorBorderColor #C09553
  LifeLineBorderColor #888888
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFDE7
  ParticipantBorderColor #C09553
  BoxBackgroundColor #FAFAFA
}

actor "Pelanggan" as Customer
boundary "Frontend Web\n(HTML/JS)" as FE
control "Backend API\n(Go Handlers)" as BE
entity "Database MySQL\n(CitraFrame)" as DB
participant "Firebase Auth" as Firebase
participant "API.co.id\n(Regional & Ongkir)" as Regional
participant "Flip Payment\nGateway" as Flip

== 1. Autentikasi & Sesi Pelanggan ==
Customer -> FE: Pilih Menu Login / Register
FE -> Firebase: Request Autentikasi (Email / Google)
Firebase --> FE: Return Firebase ID Token
FE -> BE: Kirim Token (Header Authorization Bearer)
BE -> Firebase: Verifikasi Token (FirebaseAuthMiddleware)
Firebase --> BE: Token Valid (Firebase UID)
BE --> FE: Autentikasi Berhasil (Sesi Pelanggan Aktif)

== 2. Eksplorasi Katalog & Custom Frame Builder ==
Customer -> FE: Buka Katalog Produk / Art Prints / Custom Builder
FE -> BE: GET /api/products & GET /api/prints
BE -> DB: SELECT * FROM products, art_prints
DB --> BE: Data Produk & Art Prints
BE --> FE: JSON Daftar Produk & Karya Seni
FE --> Customer: Tampilkan Katalog & Interface Custom Frame Builder

opt Visualisasi Augmented Reality (AR)
  Customer -> FE: Buka Fitur AR Preview (ar.html)
  FE -> FE: Render Simulasi WebXR 3D / Kamera AR
  FE --> Customer: Tampilkan Bingkai di Ruang Nyata / Dinding
end

== 3. Pengelolaan Keranjang Belanja (Cart) ==
Customer -> FE: Klik "Tambah ke Keranjang" (Add to Cart)
FE -> BE: POST /api/user/cart (ProductID, Qty, Details, FirebaseUID)
BE -> DB: INSERT / UPDATE cart_items
DB --> BE: Success
BE --> FE: Item Berhasil Ditambahkan
FE --> Customer: Tampilkan Halaman Keranjang Belanja

== 4. Checkout, Alamat Pengiriman, & Cek Ongkir ==
Customer -> FE: Buka Halaman Checkout
FE -> BE: GET /api/user/addresses
BE -> DB: SELECT * FROM user_addresses WHERE user_id = ?
DB --> BE: Daftar Alamat Pelanggan
BE --> FE: JSON Daftar Alamat

opt Tambah Alamat Baru
  Customer -> FE: Input Alamat & Pilih Wilayah
  FE -> BE: GET /api/regional/provinces (dan Regencies/Districts)
  BE -> Regional: Proxy Request Data Wilayah
  Regional --> BE: Data Wilayah Administrasi Indonesia
  BE --> FE: JSON Wilayah
  Customer -> FE: Simpan Alamat Baru (Opsional Pin Leaflet Map)
  FE -> BE: POST /api/user/addresses
  BE -> DB: INSERT INTO user_addresses
  DB --> BE: Success
end

Customer -> FE: Pilih Ekspedisi / Kurir Pengiriman
FE -> BE: GET /api/shipping/cost (Asal, Tujuan, Berat, Kurir)
BE -> Regional: Request Hitung Tarif Ongkir
Regional --> BE: Tarif & Estimasi Pengiriman
BE --> FE: JSON Ongkos Kirim
FE --> Customer: Tampilkan Subtotal Barang, Ongkir, & Total Bayar

== 5. Pemesanan & Pembayaran via Flip Payment Gateway ==
Customer -> FE: Klik Tombol "Buat Pesanan / Bayar"
FE -> BE: POST /api/create-payment (Order Request + Firebase Token)
BE -> DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION

alt Jika Item adalah Art Print
  BE -> DB: SELECT stock FROM art_prints WHERE id = ? FOR UPDATE
  DB --> BE: Stok Saat Ini
  BE -> DB: UPDATE art_prints SET stock = stock - qty WHERE id = ?
end

BE -> DB: INSERT INTO orders (order_uid, total_amount, status='PENDING', ...)
BE -> DB: INSERT INTO order_items (order_id, product_id, details, ...)
BE -> DB: COMMIT TRANSACTION

BE -> Flip: POST /v2/pwf/bill (Create Single Bill Tagihan)
Flip --> BE: Return JSON {payment_url, link_id}
BE -> DB: UPDATE orders SET flip_link_id = link_id
BE --> FE: Return JSON {paymentUrl, orderUid, orderId}
FE -> Customer: Redirect ke Halaman Pembayaran Flip (paymentUrl)
Customer -> Flip: Melakukan Pembayaran Sesuai Tagihan

== 6. Webhook Callback & Konfirmasi Pesanan ==
Flip -> BE: POST /api/flip/callback (Webhook Status PAID)
BE -> DB: UPDATE orders SET order_status = 'PROCESSING' WHERE flip_link_id = ?
DB --> BE: Order Status Updated
BE --> Flip: 200 OK

Customer -> FE: Akses Halaman Invoice & Riwayat Akun (/invoice, /account)
FE -> BE: GET /api/user/orders
BE -> DB: SELECT * FROM orders WHERE firebase_uid = ?
DB --> BE: Daftar Pesanan & Detail Invoice
BE --> FE: JSON Data Pesanan
FE --> Customer: Tampilkan Faktur / Invoice & Riwayat Pesanan

@enduml
